      "writtenOn": "2024-06-15T02:30:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "btw, you can use __VA_ARGS__ to have a single macro that may support 1-9 args\n\nAnyway, if you define the right macro in the perfetto headers, I don\u0027t think we should need any macro defined here. The function bodies could say exactly:\n\n```\n    PERFETO_TRACE_FUNC(SM_TAG, arg);\n```\n\nor\n\n```\n    PERFETO_SM_TRACE_FUNC(SM_TAG);\n```\n\nor\n\n```\n    PERFETO_SM_TRACE_FUNC(SM_TAG, arg1, arg2);\n```\n\nwithout any macros defined per client. We should have that (this is a lot to maintain separately).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 62,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 62,
        "endChar": 36
      },
      "revId": "e27cb1620ca9f43d39074697392ca305f3bb041c",
