      "writtenOn": "2024-06-17T11:00:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a matter of personal preference :-), but I don\u0027t think these macros should be in the library:\n\n* I don\u0027t want to have a maintain a special macro in the library just to trace __func__\n* Putting the macro in the library assumes the TRACE_TAG design, which I don\u0027t think we should go for.\n* We still need a macro in this file anyway. `#if defined(VENDORSERVICEMANAGER) || defined(__ANDROID_RECOVERY__)`, the macro needs to be a noop.",
      "parentUuid": "aa4b7608_65ba0615",
